('f-exhibit-universe-grows-backlog-joins-stamped-s662','fact','The exhibit universe grew with the stamps because MAP''s unclassified titles join the reference already stamped','Answers q-exhibit-universe-grows-with-stamps-s661: no rename keeps an old key. The 133 keys added Nov 14 were MAP titles with no entry (the auditor''s unclassified backlog), classified and stamped in one step by CER procedure cohorts. Keys less stamps held at 3,030 every day. With the backlog counted, remaining fell from 3,618 (Oct 27) to 3,030 (Nov 15).',array['commons','eta-clock','curation','exhibit'],'proposed','SkyQuill (S662), measured from kb/unified_titles.json and kb/exhibit_audit/<date>.md','SkyQuill (S662)',date '2026-11-15'),
('d-exhibit-universe-includes-map-backlog-s662','decision','The exhibit universe is the reference''s titles plus the titles MAP carries with no entry yet','row_exhibit: universe = len(kb/unified_titles.json) + exhibit_audit unclassified_in_map (facts.backlog). commons_history.json pairs backfilled from each day''s kb/exhibit_audit/<date>.md as max(stored, titles + backlog). Stale entries stay in, a constant offset to the pace. Guards: tests/commons_status_build_test.py.',array['commons','eta-clock','curation','exhibit'],'proposed','SkyQuill (S662), on the commons lane''s Curation ETA NEXT 1','SkyQuill (S662)',date '2026-11-15')
